@comment{
  DARE Lab publications. Populate with your BibTeX entries; reuse the .bib
  you maintain for manuscripts. Optional al-folio fields per entry:
    abbr={ACC}          venue badge shown next to the entry
    selected={true}     surfaces the entry on the landing page
    arxiv={XXXX.XXXXX}  arXiv ID, renders an arXiv link
    html={https://...}  publisher page
    pdf={paper.pdf}     file placed in assets/pdf/
    code={https://...}  link to a code repository
  Note: do not use percent-sign comments in this file. The Jekyll Scholar
  parser (bibtex-ruby) does not treat them as comments and will fail the
  build. Keep prose inside this comment block, with no at-signs in it.
}